  m_text: 'You are a community health worker. A client has brought in a typical meal.


    <b>Assess:</b> click each food on the plate to see its food group and portion.

    <b>Act:</b> drag foods between the plate and the side tray to balance it, then choose what to say.


    A balanced plate is about half vegetables and fruit, a quarter grains and a quarter protein.'
